# Card artwork: frames, foils, holo textures. Not distributed with this repository at all. Most of
# it derives from Pokemon Trading Card Game designs and is not this project's to license under the
# GPL it ships under, so it cannot travel with a public repo. See NOTICE.md, and
# public/img/README.md for what is missing and how to supply it.
#
# Ignore everything under public/img, then re-include only what IS ours to publish. A directory has
# to be re-included before anything inside it can be: git will not look into an excluded directory,
# so `!/public/img/foils/README.md` alone would never match.
/public/img/*
!/public/img/README.md
!/public/img/types/
!/public/img/foils/
/public/img/foils/*
!/public/img/foils/README.md
!/public/img/uploads/
# Admin-uploaded card art: user content, not source. The .htaccess beside it IS source, since it is
# the lock that stops anything in this tree being executed, so a deploy without it is an RCE hole.
/public/img/uploads/*
!/public/img/uploads/.htaccess
# The link-preview image, which is a capture of the hero and so carries the same card frames baked
# into it as a raster. Out for the same reason they are. Seo.php still points at /og.png and hard
# codes its dimensions, so a deploy supplies the file; without it, shares preview as a bare title.
/public/og.png
# Gill Sans and NeoGram are commercial typefaces this project has no right to redistribute. The
# card falls back to Cabin without them; drop your own licensed copies here for exact parity.
/public/fonts/pcg/*
!/public/fonts/pcg/README.md
# Optional local-only developer routes. Stays on the machine that needs it: routes/web.php requires
# it only when present, so a clone without it behaves exactly like production.
/routes/dev.php
# Build output of the card-model self-check, which CONTRIBUTING and CI both drop here.
/check.mjs
Homestead.json
Homestead.yaml
npm-debug.log
yarn-error.log
